+
+	  This is TrustZone wireless subsystem. The firmware is
+	  verified and booted with the help of the Peripheral Authentication
+	  System (PAS) in TrustZone.
+
 config QCOM_SYSMON
 	tristate "Qualcomm sysmon driver"
